OL,3,AJay-Z to perform at Super Bowl
OL,4,Ahalf-time show
OL,5,
OL,6,FRapper Jay-Z will perform at the Super
OL,7,FBowl half-time show in February, the
OL,8,FNFL has announced.
OL,10,FJay-Z's company Roc Nation has produced
OL,11,Fthe half-time show since 2019, and he
OL,12,Fplays a key role in selecting each
OL,13,Fyear's performer. But the hip-hop mogul
OL,14,Fhas not previously performed himself at
OL,15,Fthe NFL championship game, and the
OL,16,Fannouncement did not specify if he
OL,17,Fwould be the sole headliner.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
