OL,3,AJay-Z to perform at Super Bowl
OL,4,Ahalf-time show
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Anticipation as to who Jay-Z might
OL,7,Fhave guest star at halftime for the big
OL,8,Fgame will now kick off," the NFL said
OL,9,Fin a statement. "Of course, his wife,
OL,10,FBeyonce, will be atop the list."
OL,12,FNext year's Super Bowl LXI will take
OL,13,Fplace on 14 February near Los Angeles.
